---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Home"
  bannerImage="/images/banner.png"
  bannerEyebrow="Skrinak Creative, Inc."
  bannerHeading="Graphic Design"
  isHome={true}
>

  <div class="home-intro">
    <p>
      Skrinak Creative is a full-service design firm with a broad range of expertise
      from corporate identity to trade show design. Our limited size doesn't limit your
      company's results! In fact, we believe it's an asset. We are agile, responsive and
      affordable. Whether your business is a start-up or a global entity, we have the
      experience to ensure stellar results. At Skrinak Creative, Inc., we are committed
      to providing fresh creative, individual service, and ultimately effective marketing
      solutions for businesses of all sizes. We invite you to browse our portfolio and
      learn more about how we can help your business succeed.
    </p>
  </div>

</BaseLayout>
